  "notes": "Models: Poly Haven 1k glTF, decimated with pymeshlab and saved as OBJ; plant albedo merged with the alpha map into *_diffa_1k.png. Ground sets: roughness packed as 1k URP smoothness masks (*_mask_1k.png). Trees: fir_tree_01's 1k bark maps are used as published (fir_bark/); its twig cut-outs (twig_diff + twig_alpha) are stamped along a stem into two dense branch sprites (fir_branch/fir_branch_diffa_1k.png) by Tools/CC0FirAtlas.py; the branch normal map is flat. The scan itself (7.8M triangles) is not shipped: LongRaceScenery builds card conifers from these textures. Round 3: quiver_tree_02, cheiridopsis_succulent, lateral_sea_marker and ocean_buoy are decimated single-material OBJs; dutch_ship_medium is split by material into dutch_ship_medium_hull/_rigging/_sails, each decimated on its own (6.4k triangles in all). white_plaster_02, clay_roof_tiles_02 and weathered_planks are 1k albedo + GL normal maps used on the generated coast houses and jetties.",
